<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>AGA Adventures: Scope Update</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --text: #2f3437;
    --muted: #6b7280;
    --line: #e8e8e6;
    --bg: #ffffff;
    --panel: #f7f7f5;
    --accent: #2f6f4e;
    --warn-bg: #fbf6ec;
    --warn-line: #e6d9bd;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 56px 24px 96px;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  .doc { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 34px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }
  .lede { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 40px; }
  h2 {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 650;
    margin: 44px 0 14px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  p { margin: 0 0 14px; }
  ul.checklist { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  ul.checklist li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 9px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  ul.checklist li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .box {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    border: 1.5px solid #c9c9c5;
    border-radius: 4px;
    position: relative;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .done .box { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .done .box::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 5px; top: 1px;
    width: 4px; height: 9px;
    border: solid #fff;
    border-width: 0 2px 2px 0;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }
  .done .label { color: var(--muted); }
  .pending .box { border-style: dashed; }
  .tag {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #9a7b2f;
    background: var(--warn-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--warn-line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1px 7px;
    margin-left: 8px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    vertical-align: 2px;
  }
  .callout {
    background: var(--warn-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--warn-line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    margin: 22px 0;
  }
  .callout p:last-child, .note p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .note {
    background: var(--panel);
    border-left: 3px solid #d8d8d4;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    margin: 22px 0;
  }
  .options { display: grid; gap: 16px; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; margin-top: 6px; }
  .option {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .option h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 650; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  .price { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .option p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }
  footer {
    margin-top: 52px;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    body { padding: 36px 18px 72px; }
    h1 { font-size: 27px; }
    .options { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="doc">

  <p class="eyebrow">Project update</p>
  <h1>AGA Adventures</h1>
  <p class="lede">Status of the agreed scope, plus pricing for optimization work that sits outside it.</p>

  <h2>Agreed scope</h2>
  <ul class="checklist">
    <li class="pending">
      <span class="box"></span>
      <span class="label">Header CTA ("Book a Consultation") linking to Cal.com <span class="tag">Waiting on client</span></span>
    </li>
    <li class="done"><span class="box"></span><span class="label">FAQs updated across all pages</span></li>
    <li class="done"><span class="box"></span><span class="label">WhatsApp live chat added</span></li>
    <li class="done"><span class="box"></span><span class="label">Unnecessary capitalization removed across the site</span></li>
    <li class="done"><span class="box"></span><span class="label">Single Trek: pricing option added on the single page and on the archive card</span></li>
    <li class="done"><span class="box"></span><span class="label">Font updated</span></li>
    <li class="done"><span class="box"></span><span class="label">Themes and plugins updated</span></li>
  </ul>

  <div class="callout">
    <p><strong>One item is blocked.</strong> The header CTA needs the Cal.com booking link from the client. Once that comes through, I can wire it up straight away. Everything else in the scope is complete.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>What is already covered</h2>
  <p>The basic housekeeping side of optimization is included in the current scope: themes and plugins are up to date, fonts are fixed, and I have checked that nothing broke after the updates.</p>

  <h2>Optimization: new scope</h2>
  <p>Anything beyond that housekeeping would be a separate piece of work. Two options:</p>

  <div class="options">
    <div class="option">
      <h3>Homepage optimization</h3>
      <p class="price">NPR 7,500</p>
      <p>On page SEO, performance and accessibility work for the homepage, including image and asset handling, caching and Core Web Vitals.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="option">
      <h3>Full site optimization</h3>
      <p class="price">NPR 22,500</p>
      <p>Proper basic SEO across every page, plus full site speed optimization throughout, not just the homepage.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="note">
    <p>These two options are alternatives, not add ons. The full site price covers the homepage work as well, so it replaces the NPR 7,500 option rather than stacking on top of it.</p>
  </div>

  <footer>
    Happy to break either option down in more detail if the client wants to see exactly what is included before deciding.
  </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
